{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281160","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281160","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1028116001:0":{"text":"あら……これはフラベルさんが植えた魔法のスズランですね。","source_cn":"嗯……这是芙拉贝尔种下的魔法铃兰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76F772CDD4DCAA49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028116002:1":{"text":"本当ですね。フラベルさんと同じ、とても綺麗で暖かな気持ちになりますね。","source_cn":"真的，和芙拉贝尔一样，这朵花好美丽，还给人一种温柔的感觉呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x536E12FBFE73A612","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028116003:1":{"text":"流れた魔力もここにあるなんて、とても不思議ですね！きっとこのスズランに引き寄せられたんですよ！","source_cn":"散逸的魔力也在这里。太神奇了，它一定是被这朵铃兰花吸引来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DA4F76705997888","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028116004:1":{"text":"では、最後の記憶のかけらを呼び起こしてください。","source_cn":"请开始激活记忆碎片吧，这是最后一处了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B6337D8BFD3D2D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1028116004":{"text":"では、最後の記憶のかけらを呼び起こしてください。","source_cn":"请开始激活记忆碎片吧，这是最后一处了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B6337D8BFD3D2D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028116005:1":{"text":"うう、また魔物がくるのかなぁ？","source_cn":"诶，还会有怪物来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD98742BFBB5084FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028116006:0":{"text":"魔力のある場所はここで最後だもの。もし魔物がイヴォンヌさんの力を呑み込むために集まっているのなら、さらに凶暴になってるはずよ。","source_cn":"这是最后一处散逸的魔力，如果魔物是为了吞噬伊温小姐的力...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B5031DCF8C8E66A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028116007:0":{"text":"……よし、一層警戒を強めないと！","source_cn":"……满满会提高警惕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CDB1CE834DE7391","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028116008:0":{"text":"マスター！記憶のかけらを呼び起こしましょう！","source_cn":"主人，开始激活记忆碎片吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7ACD787EF634F066","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスター！記憶のかけらを呼び起こしましょう！","female":"マスター！記憶のかけらを呼び起こしましょう！","variant_male_record_index":"112341","variant_female_record_index":"112342","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"今回は特に用心しないとな。","source_cn":"这次要更加小心","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDF72D03ECA34E776","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"今回は特に用心しないとな。","female":"今回は特に用心しないとね。","variant_male_record_index":"61670","variant_female_record_index":"61671","document_title":"","docume